{"4810100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Molten Jaw", "steam_appid": 4810100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/2963724b5b372f9ad841cb71c404b610.poster.avif?t=1781750687\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/2963724b5b372f9ad841cb71c404b610.webm?t=1781750687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/2963724b5b372f9ad841cb71c404b610.mp4?t=1781750687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Become the Apex Predator!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Molten Jaw is a fast-paced 3D action brawler where skill fuels momentum. Chain combos, overcome enemy hordes and powerful bosses, uncover hidden secrets, unlock new playable characters, and climb from rank D to S+ through mastery and replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/33ce97ab72440651c6b0c692ae6ecf89.poster.avif?t=1781750687\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/33ce97ab72440651c6b0c692ae6ecf89.webm?t=1781750687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/33ce97ab72440651c6b0c692ae6ecf89.mp4?t=1781750687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>Momentum-Based Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build momentum through skillful play. Chain powerful combos, avoid damage, and become faster and stronger as you maintain your combat flow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>Battle Enemy Hordes and Powerful Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through challenging combat encounters filled with unique enemies, minibosses, and larger-than-life boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/2521679ae0c5bcf5a273de06c7388514.poster.avif?t=1781750687\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/2521679ae0c5bcf5a273de06c7388514.webm?t=1781750687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/2521679ae0c5bcf5a273de06c7388514.mp4?t=1781750687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏃 <strong>Platforming and Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse handcrafted levels, discover hidden paths, uncover secrets, and search every corner of the wasteland for valuable collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/81356762e2bb5fc65d33a99e89be867b.poster.avif?t=1781750687\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/81356762e2bb5fc65d33a99e89be867b.webm?t=1781750687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/81356762e2bb5fc65d33a99e89be867b.mp4?t=1781750687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 <strong>Master Every Level</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn ranks from D to S+ based on your performance. Improve your combat efficiency, find every secret, and replay levels to achieve true mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/f7d338a6290ab4817aeac8ce44e1339b.poster.avif?t=1781750687\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/f7d338a6290ab4817aeac8ce44e1339b.webm?t=1781750687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/f7d338a6290ab4817aeac8ce44e1339b.mp4?t=1781750687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>Designed for Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to improve your rankings, complete every objective, uncover every secret, and master every encounter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎁 <strong>Discover Rewards and Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hidden items and unlock cosmetics that provide additional bonuses while encouraging exploration and replayability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🦖 <strong>Unlock New Playable Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your roster by unlocking new characters, each with their own unique abilities, special attacks, and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/f72313a11242f59cec6554afd6ea30bc.poster.avif?t=1781750687\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4810100/extras/f72313a11242f59cec6554afd6ea30bc.webm